q(73, "Mexiletine uses are similar to:", ["Lidocaine", "Procainamide", "Flecainide", "Atropine"], "The mexiletine uses list starts similar to that of lidocaine.")
q(73, "Mexiletine is also used in diabetic neuropathy to reduce:", ["Tingling/numbness", "Bronchoconstriction", "Renin levels", "Aqueous humour"], "The diabetic neuropathy note says to reduce tingling/numbness.")
q(73, "Phenytoin is primarily an:", ["Antiepileptic drug", "β3 agonist", "α1 blocker", "Nitrate"], "The phenytoin line says antiepileptic drug.")
