q(73, "Pure AV nodal blockers are contraindicated in WPW because they:", ["Increase conduction through the accessory pathway", "Completely block accessory conduction", "Shorten QRS only", "Decrease atrial ectopic circuits"], "The C/I line says pure AV node blockers → ↑ conduction through accessory pathway.")
