q(76, "Digoxin is used as an ionotrope in long-term management of:", ["Chronic CHF", "Hypertensive emergency", "BPH", "Pulmonary fibrosis"], "The use line says as an ionotrope in long term mx of chronic CHF.")
q(76, "Digoxin is also used in:", ["SVT/PSVT", "Torsades acute attack", "Scorpion bite only", "Renovascular hypertension"], "The digoxin use line includes SVT/PSVT.")
q(76, "MgSO4 blocks which channel in the torsades section?", ["Ca2+ channel", "Na+ channel", "K+ channel only", "PDE5"], "The MgSO4 MOA says block Ca2+ channel.")
